
### Create book (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "publicationYear": 2008
}

### Create another book (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "publicationYear": 2018
}

### Get all books (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### Get book by ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Update book (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code - Updated",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "publicationYear": 2009
}

### Get updated book (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Delete book (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Get deleted book (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Get unknown book (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### Create book with empty title (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "publicationYear": 2008
}

### Create book with empty author (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "",
  "publicationYear": 2008
}
